                        %mo ¯
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T(s^{-1}\overline{C})
                is the cocommutative Hopf algebra generated by
                = succeed "," do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
